{{!
    @template enrol_apply/queue_filters

    The controls that narrow the applications queue.

    A GET form, and it sits OUTSIDE the decision form on purpose: manage.mustache wraps the whole
    body in a single POST form and HTML forbids nesting one form inside another, so a search box
    placed inside it would submit the decision instead.

    It carries the scope as a hidden field because a GET submit replaces the query string entirely
    rather than merging into it. It deliberately carries no paging or sorting parameters: core never
    clamps a stale page number, so keeping page three across a search that now matches four rows
    would render an empty table.

    Every chip's remove control is a real link naming the filters that survive it, so the row works
    with scripting off. Describe tags in prose here rather than writing them, because a Mustache
    comment ends at the first closing pair of braces.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none - the module attaches by data-region.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="queuefilters" on the form, the module's root.
    * data-region="searchinput" on the search field.
    * data-region="statusselect" on the status field.
    * data-region="filterfield" on every per-field and date control, each carrying data-filter
      (the token the query string and the filterset both use) and data-filterlabel (the wording a
      chip repeats), so the module needs no second copy of either.
    * data-region="chiprow" on the chip row, which the module empties and refills.
    * data-region="clearall" on the clear-all link, hidden with d-none when nothing is applied
      rather than omitted, so the module has a node to unhide instead of one to invent.
    * data-region="filtercount" on the count line, carrying data-scopetotal - the count is
      "matched of total", the refreshed table reports only the matched half in its own
      data-table-total-rows, and the total is a property of the scope that no refresh changes.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * formaction string - url the GET form submits to
    * hasscope boolean - whether a scope id must ride along
    * scopeid int - the enrol instance id
    * searchlabel string - visible label for the search field
    * searchvalue string - the term currently applied
    * searchhelp string - rendered help icon for the search field
    * statuslabel string - visible label for the status select
    * statusoptions array - value, label and selected for each option
    * hascoursefilters bool - true on the site-wide queue, which is the only scope offering the
      course and category controls; see enrol_apply\local\coursefilter
    * categorylabel, courselabel string - the two labels
    * categoryoptions, courseoptions array - value, label and selected for each option. Both
      selects are enhanced by core/form-autocomplete with ajax off, so the list is rendered whole
      and the typing filters it in the browser.
    * haschips boolean - whether any filter is applied
    * chips array - name, value, removeurl and removelabel for each applied filter
    * clearurl string - url that removes every filter
    * clearlabel string - wording of the clear-all control
    * counttext string - how many applications match, of how many
    * scopetotal int - how many the queue holds before any filter, for the module to recount with
    * groupheading string - visually-hidden legend naming what the control group does
    * hasfields boolean - whether any per-field filter is offered to this reader
    * fields array - token, label, inputid, isselect, value and options for each offered field
    * fromlabel, fromvalue, tolabel, tovalue - the applied-date bounds and their labels

    Example context (json): {
        "formaction": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/manage.php",
        "hasscope": true,
        "scopeid": 140,
        "searchlabel": "Search",
        "searchvalue": "goncalves",
        "searchhelp": "",
        "statuslabel": "Application status",
        "hascoursefilters": true,
        "categorylabel": "Course category",
        "categoryoptions": [
            {"value": "", "label": "Any category", "selected": true},
            {"value": "3", "label": "Engineering", "selected": false}
        ],
        "courselabel": "Course",
        "courseoptions": [
            {"value": "", "label": "Any course", "selected": true},
            {"value": "7", "label": "Structural mechanics", "selected": false}
        ],
        "statusoptions": [
            {"value": "", "label": "Any status", "selected": false},
            {"value": "1", "label": "Pending", "selected": true},
            {"value": "2", "label": "Deferred", "selected": false}
        ],
        "haschips": true,
        "chips": [
            {
                "filter": "search",
                "name": "Search",
                "value": "goncalves",
                "removeurl": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/manage.php?id=140",
                "removelabel": "Remove the filter Search: goncalves"
            }
        ],
        "clearurl": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/manage.php?id=140",
        "clearlabel": "Clear all",
        "counttext": "4 of 312 applications",
        "scopetotal": 312,
        "groupheading": "Narrow the queue",
        "hasfields": true,
        "fields": [
            {
                "token": "city",
                "label": "City/town",
                "inputid": "enrol_apply_filter_city",
                "isselect": false,
                "value": "Ouro Preto",
                "options": []
            },
            {
                "token": "country",
                "label": "Country",
                "inputid": "enrol_apply_filter_country",
                "isselect": true,
                "value": "BR",
                "options": [
                    {"value": "BR", "label": "Brazil", "selected": true},
                    {"value": "PT", "label": "Portugal", "selected": false}
                ]
            }
        ],
        "fromlabel": "Applied from",
        "fromvalue": "2026-08-01",
        "tolabel": "Applied to",
        "tovalue": ""
    }
}}
<form method="get" action="{{formaction}}" class="enrol_apply-filters mb-3" data-region="queuefilters">
    {{#hasscope}}<input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{scopeid}}">{{/hasscope}}
    <fieldset class="enrol_apply-filterrow">
        <legend class="visually-hidden">{{groupheading}}</legend>
        <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
            <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_search">{{searchlabel}}{{{searchhelp}}}</label>
            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="enrol_apply_search" name="search"
                   value="{{searchvalue}}" data-region="searchinput" autocomplete="off">
        </div>
        <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
            <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_status">{{statuslabel}}</label>
            <select class="form-select" id="enrol_apply_status" name="status" data-region="statusselect">
                {{#statusoptions}}
                    <option value="{{value}}" {{#selected}}selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>
                {{/statusoptions}}
            </select>
        </div>
        {{#hascoursefilters}}
            <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
                <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_category">{{categorylabel}}</label>
                <select class="form-select" id="enrol_apply_category" name="category"
                        data-region="filterfield" data-filter="category" data-filterlabel="{{categorylabel}}">
                    {{#categoryoptions}}
                        <option value="{{value}}" {{#selected}}selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>
                    {{/categoryoptions}}
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
                <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_course">{{courselabel}}</label>
                <select class="form-select" id="enrol_apply_course" name="course"
                        data-region="filterfield" data-filter="course" data-filterlabel="{{courselabel}}">
                    {{#courseoptions}}
                        <option value="{{value}}" {{#selected}}selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>
                    {{/courseoptions}}
                </select>
            </div>
        {{/hascoursefilters}}
        {{#fields}}
            <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
                <label class="form-label" for="{{inputid}}">{{label}}</label>
                {{#isselect}}
                    <select class="form-select" id="{{inputid}}" name="{{token}}"
                            data-region="filterfield" data-filter="{{token}}" data-filterlabel="{{label}}">
                        <option value="">{{#str}}choosedots, core{{/str}}</option>
                        {{#options}}
                            <option value="{{value}}" {{#selected}}selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>
                        {{/options}}
                    </select>
                {{/isselect}}
                {{^isselect}}
                    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="{{inputid}}" name="{{token}}"
                           value="{{value}}" autocomplete="off"
                           data-region="filterfield" data-filter="{{token}}" data-filterlabel="{{label}}">
                {{/isselect}}
            </div>
        {{/fields}}
        <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
            <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_appliedfrom">{{fromlabel}}</label>
            <input type="date" class="form-control" id="enrol_apply_appliedfrom" name="appliedfrom"
                   value="{{fromvalue}}" data-region="filterfield" data-filter="appliedfrom"
                   data-filterlabel="{{fromlabel}}">
        </div>
        <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield">
            <label class="form-label" for="enrol_apply_appliedto">{{tolabel}}</label>
            <input type="date" class="form-control" id="enrol_apply_appliedto" name="appliedto"
                   value="{{tovalue}}" data-region="filterfield" data-filter="appliedto"
                   data-filterlabel="{{tolabel}}">
        </div>
        <div class="enrol_apply-filterfield enrol_apply-filtersubmit">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary">{{#str}}applyfilters, core{{/str}}</button>
        </div>
    </fieldset>
    <div class="enrol_apply-chiprow" data-region="chiprow">
        {{#chips}}
            {{> enrol_apply/queue_chip }}
        {{/chips}}
        <a href="{{clearurl}}" class="enrol_apply-clearall small {{^haschips}}d-none{{/haschips}}"
           data-region="clearall">{{clearlabel}}</a>
        <span class="enrol_apply-filtercount small text-muted" data-region="filtercount"
              data-scopetotal="{{scopetotal}}" aria-live="polite">{{counttext}}</span>
    </div>
</form>
